{"id":23057,"name":"欢迎来到银河城","rarity":5,"path":"Elation","desc":"欢愉命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"城市上空，少女张扬的身影自传送门中脱出。\\n车马洪流，人影绰绰，喧闹一如既往。\\n<i>「看着确实热闹，不过——」</i>\\n\\n面前的屏幕亮起，人们的喜怒哀乐化成星星点点流向其中。\\n<i>「连NPC的疲惫值都快登顶了…」</i>\\n<i>「无聊到爆的副本，我可不玩。」</i>\\n\\n跟随手指划动，城市灯光忽明忽灭。\\n不为人知的角落中传出一声惊呼，而后，呼声震震，响彻天际。\\n<i>「所有玩家幸运值翻倍，特别天赋随机，奖励拉满…」</i>\\n<i>「载入游戏成功！就现在，玩转全场！」</i>\\n\\n少女纵身跃下，熟悉的提示音环绕在耳畔。\\n属于她的游戏时刻，已然开启。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23057,"name":"稳赢","desc":"使装备者的速度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，造成的欢愉伤害无视目标<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>的防御力。当装备者对自身单体施放终结技时，获得<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak></color>点【笑点】。该效果最多触发1次，施放<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>次普攻后重置可触发次数。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.18,0.2,20,3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.21,0.24,25,3]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.28,30,3]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.27,0.32,35,3]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.3,0.36,40,3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":52.8,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":116.16,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110261,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":200.64,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":285.12,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":369.6,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10